{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-08-03 15:30:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS' INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY VP TO SPEAK AT JEFFERIES INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON AUGUST 10", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , AUG. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SIMON MOORE , VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY, WILL SPEAK\xa0AT THE JEFFERIES INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 10, 2022 AT 8:00 A.M.'}